# Content sections to be implemented

This directory will contain the main content sections:

- Hero.tsx - Main hero section with introduction
- About.tsx - About me section
- Resume.tsx - Resume overview section
- Skills.tsx - Skills and expertise showcase
- Projects.tsx - Project portfolio grid
- Experience.tsx - Work experience timeline
- Education.tsx - Education history
- Achievements.tsx - Awards and achievements
- Certifications.tsx - Professional certifications
- CompetitiveProgramming.tsx - Coding platform profiles
- Research.tsx - Research papers and publications
- Contact.tsx - Contact information and form
